;; kafun 花粉 — seed of forest STANDS under 花粉撲滅 remediation assessment.
;; ALL SYNTHETIC (:sourcing :synthetic). Illustrative of the remediation gate's
;; decision shape — NOT real stands, NOT a cut-list / target-list. Real cadastral
;; + satellite-derived stands are an operator/Council step (G7; the legacy
;; ADR-2605100100 scout→cadastral→envoy pipeline, behind an operator flip).
;;
;; factors: emission-density / exposed-pop-weight / reforest-viability ∈ 0..1;
;;   area-ha ∈ hectares; species ∈ {:sugi :hinoki :mixed-conifer :broadleaf};
;;   carbon ∈ {:net-negative :net-neutral :net-positive} (NET OF the 再造林 recapture);
;;   sapling-supply ∈ {:none :partial :sufficient} (無花粉苗木, the L1-1 gate);
;;   replant/consent/protected ∈ bool.
;; pollen-burden = min(1, area-ha/10000) · emission-density · (0.5 + 0.5·exposed-pop-weight).
[
 ;; — passes the gate → :reforest-priority (high burden, viable replant, consent, 再造林, supply) —
 {:type :stand :id "sugi-tama-a" :name "多摩丘陵 老齢スギ人工林" :species :sugi :area-ha 8000 :prefecture :synthetic-kanto
  :emission-density 0.9 :exposed-pop-weight 0.95 :reforest-viability 0.7
  :replant true :carbon :net-negative :consent true :protected false :sapling-supply :sufficient
  :note "Old-growth sugi adjacent to dense population → highest burden; restorable → 主伐再造林 priority (L3-1)."}
 {:type :stand :id "hinoki-kii-b" :name "紀伊半島 ヒノキ人工林" :species :hinoki :area-ha 12000 :prefecture :synthetic-kinki
